* FD-07  Open-loop differential gain AVO, GBW, PM, GM; input impedance; RO
* Spec 3.1.3.1, Fig. 29: VINP = AC 1/2 at 0 degrees, VINN = AC 1/2 at 180
* degrees, Ad = (Vop - Von)/Vid.  A DC-only differential servo (E sources +
* L = 1 GH, C = 1 GF to ground, as in Fig. 7) sets the bias, so the amplifier
* is open-loop at every analysed frequency.  AC 1 mHz .. 10 GHz.
* Copy A (RL/CL load): gain, phase, input admittance i(vapa).
* Copy B (no load): AC 1/2 A into Vop and out of Von; |Vop - Von| per ampere is
*   each output's open-loop resistance RO.
* IOLP/IOLN: DC load current per output of copy A (0 A nominally; +/- for 3.3.3).
{{SEED_OPTION}}
.lib "{{MODEL_LIB}}" {{CORNER}}
{{MC_PARAM}}
.include "{{DUT_FILE}}"
.temp {{TEMP}}
.options reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-15 vntol=1e-9
VDD vdd 0 {{VDD}}
VSS vss 0 0
VCM vcm 0 {{VCM}}
* Copy A
IBIASA vdd ibiasa {{IBIAS}}
EPA spa vcm outn outp 0.5
ENA sna vcm outp outn 0.5
LPA spa xpa 1G
CPA xpa 0 1G
LNA sna xna 1G
CNA xna 0 1G
VAPA inpa xpa DC 0 AC 0.5
VANA inna xna DC 0 AC 0.5 180
XA vss ibiasa vdd vcmpin_a inpa inna outp outn {{DUT}}
RVCM_A vcm vcmpin_a 1k
RLP outp vcm {{RL}}
CLP outp 0 {{CL}}
RLN outn vcm {{RL}}
CLN outn 0 {{CL}}
IOLP 0 outp DC {{IOUT_DC}}
IOLN 0 outn DC {{IOUT_DC}}
* Copy B
IBIASB vdd ibiasb {{IBIAS}}
EPB spb vcm onb opb 0.5
ENB snb vcm opb onb 0.5
LPB spb inpb 1G
CPB inpb 0 1G
LNB snb innb 1G
CNB innb 0 1G
XB vss ibiasb vdd vcmpin_b inpb innb opb onb {{DUT}}
RVCM_B vcm vcmpin_b 1k
IOPB 0 opb DC 0 AC 0.5
IONB 0 onb DC 0 AC 0.5 180
.control
set filetype=ascii
ac dec 100 1m 10G
write {{RAW}} v(outp) v(outn) i(vapa) v(opb) v(onb)
.endc
.end
